Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:43:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 03/41] bitproxy: WireGuard .conf parser with unit tests

Pure-Kotlin parser for wg-quick configs (Proton VPN exports and others),
mirroring reference/conf-merger.py with added validation: BOM/CRLF,
comments, repeated keys, comma lists, multiple peers, bracketed IPv6 and
hostname endpoints, key/port/MTU checks. Requires an IPv4 tunnel address
and a DNS server. Adds JUnit for local unit tests.
